window.products.push({"id":661028,"name":"Industrial Pipe Wooden Shelves Restore by Pipe DÉCOR Premium Douglas Fir Wood Shelving 36 Inch Length Set of 2 Boards and 6 Straight Brackets Trail Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712V9RZGqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AUTHENTIC INDUSTRIAL PIPE AND REAL AMERICAN WOOD: Our latest PIPE DÉCOR shelves are comprised of genuine industrial pipes, flanges, and sustainably sourced Douglas Fir lumber. These heavy-duty shelves make an excellent complement to any bar, den, garage, or space of your choosing, and fit across the spectrum of vintage to modern design styles. We have taken extra care in assembling this set and want you to know that you are getting a quality product made with real pipe and genuine USA pine. SUSTAINABLE WOOD FROM NEW MEXICO: All wood used in the production of these shelves was sourced in northern New Mexico in conjunction with the Collaborative Forest Restoration Program (CFRP). CFRP is a program funded by the USDA Forest Service to improve forest health and reduce the risk of wildland fires. This wood was collected with the goal of maintaining the health and productivity of the land in which it was gathered and proudly displays some of what the American Southwest has to offer. UNIQUE COLOR AND GRAIN: Each Douglas Fir board is unique in both and color and grain. This Trail Brown is on the dark side of medium brown with orange accents. Please take a look at some of the great photos we have taken of these shelves to get a better idea of what these might look like in your space. The shelves that you get will be slightly different than those pictured, but that is the appeal of real wood, no one piece or finish is the exact same. COMPONENTS AND SPECIFICATIONS: This set comes with (2) shelves, (12) flanges, (6) 8-inch pipes, screws, anchors, and a set of instructions. Each wood shelf measures 36 inches in length, 7 inches in wide, and 1 inch in height (thickness). We have weight tested these and are confident in asserting that you should have no issues putting 50 pounds of evenly distributed weight on a single shelf that is only screwed into your dry wall. WE ARE HERE TO HELP: Please reach out to us should you have any questions, concerns, or complaints. We take pride in the quality products that we offer and the care that we provide our customers. Please take a look at the wide array of other PIPE DÉCOR pieces and kits that we have for sale to give your space a more complete look as well. Have a wonderful day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712V9RZGqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PIPE DECOR","source_asin":"B07XTP7NLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XTP7NLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XTP7NLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
