window.products.push({"id":661085,"name":"Spurtles Kitchen Tools As Seen On TV, 7Pcs Wooden Spurtle Set Spatula Set, Natural Premium Acacia Wooden Spoons for Cooking Heat Resistant Cooking Ute","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ea7rcJETL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👩‍🍳【7 in One Wooden Spurtle Set】Restaurant-grade spurtles kitchen tools as seen on tv designed to perform an array of kitchen tasks finished with food-grade, natural acacia wooden to highlight the distinctive, beautiful wood grain, the handle is delicately designed which is entirely made thicker, longer, and more comfortable to hold. The spurtle scraper is slightly curved for better experiences including stirring salad, flipping steak, mixing seasoning, baking and fishing out pasta, etc. 🌳【Premium Acacia Wood & Eco-Friendly】Our spurtle wooden cooking utensils are made of 100% high-quality pure natural acacia wood, which is BPA-free, environment-friendly materials. Using High-Temperature Carbonization Technology, burnished at least three times, smooth and without any burr. Acacia wood is safe on every cooking surface and does not transfer heat to your hand as metal cookware would. It is healthier, safer, wear-resistant, and durable than an ordinary spatula set. 👍【Scratch-Proof & Heat-Resistant】Our wooden utensils for cooking is heat-resistant and scratch-proof to use with nonstick pans, pots, and ceramic dishware. The wooden ribbon-shaped pots are designed with rounded edges and no sharp parts to avoid scratching pots and pans during cooking. They have excellent heat resistance and will not melt like silicon when stirred in hot soup. They will not change the flavor of delicious food, and ensure absolute healthy meals. 😍【Easy to Clean and Maintain】The spurtles kitchen tools as seen on tv of acacia makes them easy to clean. Simply rinse them with warm water and light soap with a soft sponge. After cleaning, please make sure it is dried thoroughly and it is highly recommended that you smear the surface with olive oil for better maintenance. The user-friendly design is easy to store and can be hung on the wall when not in use, helping you to organize the kitchen well and keep it tidy at all times. 🎁【Best Gifts for Mom from Daughter】Our wooden kitchen utensil set is packed with a canvas drawstring bag and a kraft paper gift box. This must be a favorite gift for people who love cooking, baking, and so on, adds a beautiful view to your kitchen that you can give to your family, friends and colleagues as a gift. We are is committed to providing the best products and services. If you have any questions, we provide a 24-hour online service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ea7rcJETL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hiqneuen","source_asin":"B0B3ND8YMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3ND8YMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3ND8YMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
