window.products.push({"id":661096,"name":"Rack It Up Half Moon Wall Pot Rack with 8 hooks, Steel Gray Hammertone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ushDXyo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No matter the size of the kitchen, kitchen space is almost always limited. We love to cook but don't like having to dig through cluttered drawers, cupboards and cabinets to find what we need. Cookware can take up a large amount of our kitchen space. For the past three centuries, cooks and chefs have solved this problem by using wall and ceiling mounted pot racks. RACK IT UP a value-priced pot rack line, has expanded on this concept with its Half Moon Pot Rack. With this wall mounted rack you'll be able to hang your favorite cookware and utensils for easy access and save precious counter and cabinet space. Notice how the back bar protrudes away from the wall so you can attach even more utensils. Plus, this rack adds beauty and charm to one of your favorite gathering rooms. It's constructed of durable steel and includes super strong drywall anchors that are very easy to install and does not require bolting to joists or studs. Hang whatever you want; once in place, this rack will hold up to 100 pounds. It's also light weight (just 5 lbs.) so you won't need a handyman to install it. Keep your kitchen accessories organized and convenient so you can spend less time fighting with your kitchen and more time loving it. Rack includes 8 pot hooks, assembly hardware and choice of mounting hardware including traditonal wood screws and super strong drywall anchors. Pot rack measures: 14\"W by 7\"D by 16\"H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ushDXyo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enclume","source_asin":"B001ASQRKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ASQRKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ASQRKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
