window.products.push({"id":661131,"name":"Blanket Buddy Elastic Bed Sheet Straps, Keeps You and Your Kids Covered and Warm, Easy to Install Adjustable Sheet and Blanket Clips Fasteners Gripper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515T1B1Xe5L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Multipurpose Bed Sheet Stays - These versatile blanket clips are designed to secure to the bottom edges of your blankets, comforters and flat or fitted sheets to keep them bunching up, shifting, or separating when you move while sleeping. Get a Better Night's Rest - Keep your blankets and sheets in place with our sheet straps makes it easier for you to stay warm and cozy throughout your entire sleep cycle, so you aren't constantly waking up trying to cover yourself. Strong Flexible Straps and Clips - Our mattress straps to hold sheets in place are designed to flex and retract, and move while maintaining a firm grip on your fabric, which is important for keeping them in place without limiting your movement. Secure, Easy-to-Use Clasp Design - Blanket Buddy bed sheet clips are designed with heavy-duty plastic teeth that won't puncture or damage even the most delicate fibers and hold your sheets and blankets while sleeping in place. The adjustable bed buckle allows you to control how firm or loose you want your blankets to feel and also allows you to find the right length for every bed size. Great For Solo or Partner Sleeping - These fitted sheet clips work with a wide range of bedding options which means you can use them on your kid's bed to keep covers from being kicked off or your bed to keep your spouse from hogging the blankets. Make Your Bed In Seconds - Since the Blanket Buddy keeps the bottom corners of your bed is practically made, simply grab the top of your covers and pull or toss them upwards and you're done.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515T1B1Xe5L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blanket Buddy","source_asin":"B09D8M21MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D8M21MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D8M21MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
