window.products.push({"id":661146,"name":"Gree 8000 BTU Window Air Conditioner with Remote Control, 3 in 1 Mini Air Conditioner Window Unit with Cooling, Dehumidifier, Fan functions, Quiet Win","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":328.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKDq7ZpQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maximum Comfort for Rooms: This 3-in-1 unit includes: cooling, dehumidification, and fan only. The dehum mode can remove 59.28 Pint water for one day, easy to balance humidity levels in the room to maintain your comfort . It also has energy-saving and automatic cooling two modes, which can provide total flexibility with optimal home comfort and air conditioner efficiency. Low-noise Operation: This quiet air conditioner reaches sounds as low as 52 . The high efficiency inverter system warrants ultra low noise and vibration and keeps the cool air flowing with minimal disruption and ideal for nighttime use in bedrooms. Smart Temperature Control: Gree window air conditioners use the unique \"I FEEL\" technology, which more accurately senses and adjusts the indoor temperature. If the controller receives an I FEEL command, it will work to the ambient temperature value sent by the remote controller, which is sent every 10 minutes. Easy to Remove: It’s the perfect choice for your next home improvement or home office project and better than any clunky portable air conditioner. Only 50 pounds makes this ac unit easy to remove anywhere you want. Energy Saving: This energy-saving certificated AC features high quality compressor for more efficient cooling and longer working life; makes this Window AC better for the environment and your wallet. Easy Installation: Our window unit is compact in design and is easy to install without any significant modifications to the existing window frame. All installation accessories are included in the package. You only need to have a screwdriver to complete the entire installation. Please see the included instruction manual for further details. Warranty: 1 Year worry-free warranty comes with each Gree product to ensure the quality of our brand to our customers. Our team is happy to help if any questions or issues arise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKDq7ZpQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREE","source_asin":"B09Q22CGYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q22CGYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q22CGYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
