window.products.push({"id":661159,"name":"IKAPE Coffee Products, 58MM Coffee Distributor, Gravity Adaptive Espresso Distributor Fits All 58.35MM Espresso Portafilter, Compatible with 58.35MM R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OQ-52waRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖 Fits for 58mm Breville Portafilters ☕: Made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, this 58mm espresso gravity distributor works with all 58.35mm portafilters. Moreover, the espresso distributor is compatible with the 58mm Rancilio portafilters. For a 58 or 58.35-mm bottomless portafilter, you need to choose a 58 mm coffee distributor. 💖 Disruptive Dispenser Innovation Design ☕: This new 58MM coffee distributor features a gravity adaptive distributor design. You don't need to adjust the depth manually, it dispenses the distribution in a free-fall format to distribute coffee powder, reversing the manual depth adjustment of the past. The four-blade spiral design at the bottom tamps down the plane of coffee powder in your portafilter basket, ensuring a consistent, even plane at all times. 💖Adaptive Adjustment of Powder Depth ☕: This espresso distributor features a conspicuous depth marker scale. No need to adjust the depth, its adaptive adjustment depth technology will give you a whole new distribution tool experience. Just pick it up gently and dispense. Even novices can easily set the optimal coffee extraction depth for a consistent and even plane. 💖 A must-have appliance for coffee competitions ☕: Gently pick up this gravity-adaptive distributor, and you'll have a perfect coffee plane that eliminates the variables in making espresso for even extraction and a more balanced espresso flavor. Without a doubt, it will be a great helper for your espresso-making. let's be professional baristas!!! 💖Our philosophy ☕: IKAPE is a brand created by a group of espresso-loving baristas who are committed to providing quality accessories and tools to get the best espresso coffee. We also want to convey our philosophy of making fine coffee to more consumers. In addition, we offer a one-year after-sales service. When you are unsatisfied with your purchase, you can contact us at any time, and we will refund 100% of the money, or you can donate to a group in need and pass on your good deed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OQ-52waRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKAPE","source_asin":"B0C4YQWZZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4YQWZZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4YQWZZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
