window.products.push({"id":661183,"name":"Silver Pearls Mini Photo Frame [Set of 12]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kUXw+JmVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Like a strand of elegant pearls dipped in silver and crafted with a contemporary flair, Kate Aspen's pearl-inspired mini photo frame favor is playfully and uniquely designed to showcase lasting memories of your happiest celebrations Features and facts: Smart, silver-finish frame with 34 decorative pearl-like accents Holds a 3\" x 2 1 4\" photo Back of frame is velvety black Frame measures approximately 3 1 2\" x 2 1 2\" ... It makes for a great and unique gift for your wedding reception, bridal & baby shower or any other special event. NOTE: This item is shipped directly from our provider and it usually takes 5-7 days to leave the warehouse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kUXw+JmVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate Aspen","source_asin":"B00IFJGFQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IFJGFQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IFJGFQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":661184,"name":"13.5'' Microwave Glass Turntable Tray Plate F06015Q00AP by Beaquicy - Replacement for Panasonic L-G Microwave - Replaces 30QBP4119 TJF06015Q00AP","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAvsNoBPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【13.5 INCHES】-- The F06015Q00AP Glass Turntable Plate is suitable for use in a microwave oven. This glass turntable is 13.5 inches in diameter and has three evenly spaced grooves in the bottom to hold the glass turntable in place in the bottom of the microwave oven. By rotating the glass plate the food is heated evenly and collects spills during heating when the microwave oven heating. The surface of the glass turntable is smooth but finely engraved with a pattern that allows for easy cleaning while increasing friction. ►Please measure the inside of the microwave before purchasing to ensure it will fit a 13 1/2\" turntable. ✅【GLASS】-- The F06015Q00AP Microwave Plate Replacement is made from high quality glass and has been rigorously produced and tested by the manufacturer and has the advantages of high temperature resistance, smooth surface, high friction, easy cleaning and long life.The back of the plate has a smooth and subtle pattern design which increases friction and makes the dish more non-slip. The edges of the glass dish are curved, rounded and smooth to prevent problems with cuts on the edges. This 13 1/2 inches F06015Q00AP Microwave Glass Turntable Tray is easy to install and remove, making it convenient for cleaning glass trays. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The 13-1/2 F06015Q00AP Microwave Glass Turntable Tray Plate support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ►Package includes 1 x 13.5 inch F06015Q00AP Microwave Plate. When cleaning the microwave simply remove the 13.5\" microwave glass turntable to clean it, which is easier and more convenient than cleaning the whole microwave. This glass dish does not leave stains and is easy to clean. This glass turntable is easy to clean with a cloth, paper towel, soap or in the dishwasher. The high quality glass makes this turntable more hard-wearing and heat resistant, extending its lifespan. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MANY MODELS】-- F06015Q00AP Microwave Glass Turntable Plate compatible with Panasonic, L-G microwave. Replace: F06015Q00AP, 30QBP4119, TJF06015Q00AP. ►13.5'' F06015Q00AP Microwave Glass Tray Compatible: NNG463MF, NNG463WF, NNG464MF, NNG464MM, NNG464WF, NNS443BF, NNS443WF, NNSA631B, NNSA631W, NNSA651S, NNSA661S, NNSD681S, NNSN643SAZ, NNSN651B, NNSN651W, NNSN661S, NNSN671S, NNSN686S, NNST681S, NNST641W, NNST651W, NNST661S, NNST671S, NNST663S, NNST663SC, NNSD691S, NNSD691SD, NNSN66KB, NNSN65KW, NNSN67HS, NNSN67KS, NNSN68KS, NNSN936W, NNSN97HS, NNST557M, NNST557W, etc. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】-- The installation of 13.5 inches F06015Q00AP Microwave Turntables Replacement is simple. Before installation, please disconnect the power supply and put on working gloves. Remove the broken glass turntable, line up the three notches on the new glass turntable with the bush coupler in the middle of the bottom of the microwave oven and snap it in place. NOTE: After installation, please rotate the glass turntable to ensure that it rotates smoothly, if it does not, please remove the turntable and reinstall it. For safety reasons, when cracks appear on the glass plate, please replace them promptly to prevent the potential for blowing up during the heating process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAvsNoBPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B088PPBY3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088PPBY3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088PPBY3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
