window.products.push({"id":661205,"name":"Crocon Ceramic Colorful Large Coffee Mug | Big Tea Cup | Handmade | Kitchen Dining | Dishwasher | Novelty | Microwave Safe | Warm & Cold Drinks | Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TaSfhSPGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ceramic mugs are the most neutral in terms of flavor. The handle of a mug keeps the hand away from the hot sides of a mug. Big handle can keep it from rotating when you try to hold the mug, which helps you enjoy your tea/coffee comfortably. This Beautiful Ceramic mug with unique design and shades Handmade in INDIA, They're good to use for both cold and hot beverages and are microwave-safe. Your Tea/coffee will stay warmer much longer. keeping it as hot as possible can let you enjoy the deliciousness for longer. They do not hold on to flavors from other drinks, You can enjoy a variety of beverages in them without lingering smells or flavors. Ceramic mugs are easier to clean when compared to the glass mug, Very simple and classy design. Each mug has its own unique design as it is handmade, Choose your own unique mug and makes a great gift for your loved ones. Ceramic mugs are the most neutral in terms of flavor. The handle of a mug keeps the hand away from the hot sides of a mug. Big handle can keep it from rotating when you try to hold the mug, which helps you enjoy your tea/coffee comfortably. Makes a wonderful gift - Ceramic lovers, and for anyone wanting to spread love. ceramic is a solid and neutral material, it neither absorbs nor imparts flavors, leaving coffee to taste just as it should.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TaSfhSPGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crocon","source_asin":"B099W8JY6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099W8JY6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099W8JY6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
