window.products.push({"id":661422,"name":"Nature’s Decorations - Luxury Agate Bookends, Non-Skid Book Stoppers, Agate Decor Crystal Bookends for Home or Office, Polished Stone Bookends, Set of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eBrrnuxdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Agate Bookstopper - Instantly fall in love with the subtle, chic accent of our pure polished bookends. Each unique stone trim creates a mesmerizing pattern, adding an elegant touch to any bookshelf while holding both your light and heavy books in place. One-of-A-Kind Geo Bookends - Because of their natural origins, these crystal book holders have distinctive shapes, patterns, and colors. Some agate book shelf stoppers have hollowed cores, while others don’t. So they’re all remarkable in their own way. Your Functional Home Decor - Use our crystal book ends as decorative accents for shelf, paperweight, or as a display. These geo crystal decors have non-skid, scratch-free rubber bumpers to firmly hold your books and protect your furniture from damage. Different Colors and Sizes - Olympus Minerals’ agate natural home decors are available in small, medium, large, and extra-large. They also come in 7 dazzling colors: natural, black, blue, brown, green, pink, and teal. Choose the set that matches your home interior. A Thoughtful Gift - With their unparalleled beauty, our agate bookends make great presents for all occasions. Your loved ones will surely appreciate these appealing artistic ornaments!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eBrrnuxdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nature's Decorations","source_asin":"B09RTPDXB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RTPDXB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RTPDXB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
