window.products.push({"id":661484,"name":"Made in Japan-Great Luck Feng Shui Golden Dragon-with a Crystal Ball to Make Wish Come True, Dragon Figurine-Traditional Craft Takaoka copperware, wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t0AJ4rY9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"“I’ve been unlucky recently…” “I want to make a big change this year!” “I want to bring luck!” Introducing the “Great Fortune Feng Shui Gold Dragon”, bringing you luck and money fortune. Attracts earth qi (vital energy) and brings you great fortune! “Great Fortune Feng Shui Gold Dragon” is a propitious ornament that brings prosperity qi to your house and will gift you wishes and money fortune.  Gathering the delicacy from the traditional Japanese craft, Takaoka doki’s (Takaoka copperware) metal processing technology, the detailed and powerful shape is full with the spirit of the dragon’s divine power as if it will come upon instantly. The Takaoka doki is a famous traditional craft not only in Japan, but all over the world with its history for more than 400 years (since Edo era) producing many metal works other than copperwares by utilizing their various technics. In Feng Shui, dragons are a symbol of earth qi and the dragon’s path is called Long Mai. It is thought that the qi flows with the great river. In Japan, when people tried to build cities back in the Edo period, they used Feng Shui’s secret method,” Four Symbols” (four mythological creatures in the Chinese constellations). They made the east river as Seiryu and brought the prosperity qi flowing with the Long Mai to the cities. The Nyoi hoju which the dragon holds is a sacred jewel that is said to grant every wish and is made with a crystal that is known to hold spiritual power. This crystal is believed to be as the sacred water crystal from the ancient times. Enshrine this “Feng Shui Gold Dragon” in your living room, entrance or anywhere in the east direction and it will pull the earth qi bringing you great fortune rising upwards like a dragon to you and your house. ●Size (approximately)/ Height 4.13 X Width 8.66 X Length 3.74inch ●Weight (approximately)/ 22.92oz ●Material/ Main body: alloy,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t0AJ4rY9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07KS1YY9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KS1YY9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KS1YY9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
