window.products.push({"id":661487,"name":"Midwest Homebrewing and Winemaking Supplies Party Star Deluxe Tap System","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":144.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DRU-CvVBL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Strong please note: these kegs make a long journey from Germany and as result, many arrive with small dents. These are of no cause for concern and do not affect the functionality in any way. Thanks for your understanding!/strong this system is perfect for the person who doesn't want to dedicate a refrigerator to a full size keg system. Simply prime your beer with 3 oz. Of priming sugar, transfer into the mini keg, and in 2 -3 weeks you are ready to drink. Four 5L mini kegs is all you need for one batch of beer. You use 16 gm. CO2 cartridges to dispense the beer, but they cannot be used to carbonate the beer. Because you are using CO2, a keg will stay fresh for up to 5 - 6 weeks. You will use 1 CO2 cartridge per keg. Each mini keg will last for 6 - 8 uses before needing to be replaced. The party star Deluxe Tap system includes: party star Deluxe Tapper 4- 1. 33 gallon mini kegs 4- reusable rubber bungs and 6 - 16 gram CO2 cartridges (1 per keg use). party star Deluxe Tap system, country of origin - Germany, manufacturer name - Midwest home brewing and winemaking supplies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DRU-CvVBL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Midwest Homebrewing and Winemaking Supplies","source_asin":"B074Q7MGT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074Q7MGT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074Q7MGT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
