window.products.push({"id":661696,"name":"LOAOL Rainbow Bed Canopy, Kids Canopy Princess Girls Fairy Dream Tent with 28 Multi-Colored, Crib Canopy Hanging Netting for Bedroom, Canopy Pink Dome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wAgU1wD0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RAINBOW MAGIC FOR GIRLS: This RAINBOW BED CANOPY is larger size, Extra-long at 8.5 feet high and with a 220’’ base. Perfect fit for a single bed, kind bed and queen bed. The kids bed canopy is composed of blue, yellow, pink and purple colors, like a real rainbow. Larger size makes your kids’ room more like a Magic Rainbow Princess room. 40D ENCRYPTION MATERIAL GREAT QUALITY: At present, hanging canopy for bedroom is mostly made of 12D-15D fabrics in Amazon. Our crib canopy is made of 40D fabric (100% polyester material), which has high density mesh, durable and soft, strong elasticity and resilience, Super lightweight, and better child protection than 30D, giving children a more comfortable and safe environment. LOAOL princess bed canopy is a high-quality gift! EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Easy to assemble, Easy to hang, everything parts you need is in the RAINBOW CANOPY box, including: 1*rainbow bed canopy, 1* steel ring, 1*adhesive tape, 1*hook, 2*screws and 50*colorful luminous stars stickers. It was super easy to put up this extra large bed canopy, and only takes a few seconds to see the beautiful girlsroom decor hanging in the room. READING NOOK & CALMING CORNER: This canopy tent for bed is Prefect for new calming corner / reading nook. You can try to hang canopy girl canopy in the corner above a large bean bag chair to use as a calming/reading nook or put it over your kids' bed. It also Makes a great READING NOOK in the playroom. COLORFUL LUMINOUS STARS AS GIFTS: We will give the STARS as a GIFT, which is a great addition to her bed room. You can also stick the stars anywhere you like, such as: our girls bed canopy, walls, ceilings, etc. These stars in our twin bed canopy have four colors: pink, green, blue, and yellow. They can glow in the night, and it’s very vivid. They charge up in the natural light. Girls will love going to bed every night under this magical tulle rainbow canopy with luminous stars above it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wAgU1wD0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOAOL","source_asin":"B0BM9LLWY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM9LLWY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM9LLWY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
