window.products.push({"id":661798,"name":"UniqXmas Personalized Fireman Christmas Ornament 2023 - Free Customization | Firefighter Badge for Xmas Tree | Unique Keepsake for Fireman Emergency R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NO7eC64IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made with high-quality and durable polyresin, our ornaments ensure long-lasting use. The decorations are painted by the hand of an amazing artist, with care and dedication, to offer you an amazing Christmas ornament! Our ornaments are super light and have a ribbon loop which makes them easy to attach to the Christmas tree branches. FREE CUSTOMIZATION Our highly specialized calligraphy artist customizes your ornament for free. CUSTOMIZED TO YOUR LIKING We believe ornaments and Christmas trees should be personal. That’s why you can customize this ornament to your liking. Here’s how: Click the “Customize Now” button above/to the right; Click the “Customize Now” button above/to the right; Enter in your personalized information; Enter in your personalized information; Please use only Latin characters; Please use only Latin characters; Please review the text and ensure there are no spelling errors; Please review the text and ensure there are no spelling errors; Place your order; Place your order; This works for all of our customized ornament products! It will take just a few minutes. COMPLIMENTARY RIBBON LOOP Our ornament comes with a complimentary ribbon loop matching your ornament for easy hanging and display. Now you don’t have to run to the store to go buy a ribbon at the last second. THE PERFECT GIFT If you want to surprise your family member, sister, mother, cousin, child, grandkid, friend, or coworker with a Christmas gift they won’t likely forget, consider this beautiful ornament today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NO7eC64IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UniqXmas","source_asin":"B09K7ZHG58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7ZHG58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7ZHG58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":661799,"name":"Lolita Bottle Stopper, Graduation","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kJHkeEywL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gorgeous bottle stopper make a perfect hostess gift. Our metal glass dome Graduation bottle stopper is the perfect gift for the person with a love for the finer things. When shopping for partyware, a Girl's Night Out, or just the perfect gift, consider purchasing the variety of options in the Lolita collections provided by the Santa Barbara. Santa Barbara Design Studio features designs by Tracy 'Lolita' Yancy. This high quality glassware is a unique piece of art and comes individually gift boxed. Since 1976, it has been our mission to create beautifully designed, high-quality giftware products that you are inspired to give and want to keep. Our passion for finding the next wonderful product has translated into a broad line drawn from the works of talented and trendsetting designers. Santa Barbara Design creates products for every day in your home and kitchen and gifts for all occasions. Our goal is to provide unique gifts that recognize and commemorate each of these milestones with fun and original products that make you say \"WOW.\"To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. Today, many of the original handcrafted pieces produced by Santa Barbara Ceramic Design in the late 1970's and early 1980's have become sought after collector's items. Likewise, the beauty, high quality and precision with which the company creates its current glass and ceramic products may make them the collectibles of the next millennium.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kJHkeEywL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B004TTXCQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004TTXCQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004TTXCQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":661800,"name":"RECORD LOLLY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512anjx5vgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512anjx5vgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPKPC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPKPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPKPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
