window.products.push({"id":661845,"name":"Rattan Mirror, Bohemian Mirror Frame Woven Mirror for Wall décor for Living Room, Bedroom, or Any Room décor. Round Rattan Mirror for Boho décor, Hand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JCnIXCSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FERVOUR OF RATTAN: Our woven wall decor is made from natural rattan, a natural fibre known for its strength, durability, and naturally occurring artistic and bohemian look. The glass is fitted in the frame with delicacy and utmost care to give the entire circular decor a rustic, realistic, and natural look. The beige/brownish frame will most certainly bring up a unique feeling to any wall you decide to hang it on. HANDWOVEN FOR 'THE' HUMAN TOUCH: Each piece of Rattan Wall Mirror is weaved by the hands of our expert artisans who have mastered the craft of weaving and molding rattan and glass over years. This handwoven round rattan/wicker wall mirror will provide you years of durability and sustainability. Being lightweight, the hanging mirror can be carried and transported with ease to any room you wish to hang it. FROM AND TO THE BOHO LANDS: Madhu International's vintage style wall decor is artistic, exquisite, creative, imaginative, stylish, and above all, it gives you the most fancied and desired bohemian or the boho look. The rustic piece of art will be a perfect fit for any wall of any room. Making a unique & impeccable addition to your residence this round decorative mirror will add a new dimension to make your room appear larger & brighter as it reflects natural light. AN EXEMPLARY PIECE OF ART FOR YOUR HOME: Authentically composed, the round wall art comes in three designs, Sun, Sunburst, and Circle. Each unique in their way will fit in just perfectly anywhere you want it to, be it the living room, bedroom, bathroom, lounge, office, entryway, corridor, above your bed, dresser, or above the fireplace. This eco-friendly rattan mirror adds a natural texture & bohemian flair – no matter whether this mirror is hung. CLEANING PROTECTION AND SIZE: Each of the masterpieces is ideally sized at 12\" / 30cm in diameter: Circle mirror measures: 5.5\" / 14cm. To clean the wall decor we recommend wiping with a soft and damp cloth; do not place it near a radiator or other source of heat. No matter which design you go for, each of them comes with a pre-attached fixture for easy hanging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JCnIXCSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madhu International","source_asin":"B0BG834SLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG834SLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG834SLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
