window.products.push({"id":661912,"name":"Masterpiece Artist Canvas 43032 Monet PRO 1-1/2\" Deep, 12\" x 24\", Cotton 10.5oz - 3X - Monterey Most Popular","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HHN+DH2WL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"Product Description This 12x24 size is in the 2:1 Aspect Ratio. Monterey is our 7 oz. raw, 10.5 oz. finished, cotton canvas, sized and double primed with archival quality acrylic gesso, producing a ground impervious to paints leaching through and harming the fabric. Suitable for most all paint types, like oils, acrylics, and alkyds. It has a uniform texture and a medium tooth, which is easy on your brushes. There is a 1/2\" gap between the canvas and frame, eliminating the unwanted lines that occur when the gap is less. We never use finger joints in our wood frames, which often fail under tension and over time - the glue joints give-up, and are unsuitable for paintings intended to last for centuries. Patented keyable brace allows the canvas frame to be tensioned in the middle, where it's needed the most! The Stretcher Bars are slotted in the center to accept the brace. Due to our unique design, the brace may be removed, if desired. Both corner keys and brace keys are pre-installed. Stretched using our proprietary MuseumWrap method, producing a drum-tight-stretch up to 50% tighter than other methods, and with balanced tension across the surface. The corners are uncut and neatly folded, making it possible to remove and restretch the canvas on the same size frame. From the Manufacturer For 50+ years, the passion of the Masterpiece team is building the finest artist canvas in America.  Just touch one of these impressive products and you’ll immediately discern the quality characteristics that separate this canvas from any other. Masterpiece takes pride in using high quality materials, employing unparalleled workmanship, and continually upping the bar on quality. The importance of artists using a quality made canvas cannot be overstressed.  If you use high quality paints and brushes, then don’t waste your resources on an inferior canvas not worthy of your own time, talent, and reputation.Masterpiece canvases are built to last well beyond the artist's lifetime…into the next millennium.  Savvy art buyers and art enthusiasts understand that the value of a painting increases when the materials used to create it are of equal quality to the artwork itself.  Using a well-made canvas is an investment in your own legacy.Why are Masterpiece canvases so good?  It starts with the canvas itself.  Natural fiber canvas materials, like 100% cotton and Belgian Linen, are selected and inspected. A sizing is then applied to the canvas that becomes a barrier between the ultimate primer and the canvas material.  The primer is specifically designed to provide the ultimate surface upon which your paints will join with the canvas, either chemically and/or mechanically, providing a reliable base or ground for your art.The canvas is then mounted onto a state-of-the-art Monet Pro frame. When frame sizes are 16” or larger, a brace is applied to the frame; for example, a 16x20 has a single brace, and a 20x20 is cross braced in both directions. The braces prevent the stretcher bar frame from bowing-in so the canvas stays tighter….which is a welcome feature when you paint on the canvas, making the surface more responsive to the artist’s touch. And the canvas stays tight after it’s painted. To increase the tension further, press-in the corner keys and the brace keys further into the slots, which adds tension in the corners and the middle of the canvas, where the tension is needed the most!Monet Pro canvas is MuseumWrapped, which is Masterpiece’s proprietary stretching technique that achieves: a drum-tight stretch, balanced tension across the canvas surface, neatly folded un-cut corners, and paintable edges. It’s the absolute best way to stretch a canvas.When your art matters, choose Monet Pro…a truly professional canvas in every way!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HHN+DH2WL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Masterpiece","source_asin":"B005G2WCC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005G2WCC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005G2WCC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":661913,"name":"Personalized Gymnastics Christmas Ornaments Gift 2022 - Tumbling Cartwheel Custom Figurine (Male) Boy Little Kid Grandson Son Handstand with Name - Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FWMqi1HCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized Gymnastics Christmas Ornaments Gift 2022 - Tumbling Cartwheel Custom Figurine (Male) Boy Little Kid Grandson Son Handstand With Name - Handmade & Free Customization This Personalized Christmas Ornament 2022 will complete your Christmas Tree Decoration! It is a perfect Christmas gift for kids, a unique Christmas gift for children which can be used as cute figurines on walls, son ornament, daughter ornament, granddaughter ornament, grandson ornament, niece ornament, or nephew ornament.. It will be a cute keepsake for Grandparents or Parents who are looking for Christmas ornaments for children, personalized Christmas Ornaments for Kids. They are also good ideas for birthdays or Christmas gifts for 2-3-4-5-6-7 years old birthday boys or birthday girls. Every Christmas everyone wonders and asks. - Santa Tell Me, What Will You Bring Us?🎅🎁🎄 And here is a surprise from him! It is not only a gift, but a gift specially prepared for your name and year designed for each special occasion. Santa is always watching you; He prepared each ornament as a memory of milestones in your life: You will fall in LOVE with our store. We have a wide collection including; Baby’s First Christmas Ornament, Kid Ornament, First Day Of School Ornament, Graduation Ornament, Profession Ornament– (Nurse, Teacher and many more!)Engagement Ornament, Married Ornament, Baby Expecting Ornament, Family Ornaments, Sports Ornaments (Football Ornament, Basketball Ornament, Golf Ornament), Dog Ornament, Cat Ornament and many others! If you need Personalized Ornament 2022, you are in good hands. Welcome to Santa Tell Me family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FWMqi1HCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Tell Me","source_asin":"B09KWLW9NB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KWLW9NB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KWLW9NB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":661914,"name":"Paris France Skyline B&W by Michael Tompsett, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cmh05+AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a watercolor skyline of Paris, France. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cmh05+AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01MQYFX9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-661914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MQYFX9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MQYFX9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
